.TH NN-PARTITION 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-partition \- partition a graph onto an accelerator vs CPU
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn partition [options] <model>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Assign nodes to accelerator or CPU from a JSON accelerator description.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-accelerator FILE
JSON accelerator description.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn partition model.onnx --accelerator my_npu.json
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-target(1), nn-compat(1)
